---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import SocialLinks from '../components/SocialLinks.astro';
import { OPERATOR } from '../data/site';
import { registry } from '../data/registry';

const liveTools = registry.indexable().length;
---

<Prose
  title="About NiftyFix"
  description="Why NiftyFix exists, how its tools work on your device, what it promises, and who builds it."
  path="/about/"
  lede="NiftyFix gets your files ready for wherever they need to go, without uploading them anywhere."
>
  <h2>Why it exists</h2>
  <p>
    Application portals, exam forms and offices all have rules: a photo of exactly 200 × 230 pixels,
    a signature between 10 and 20 KB, a PDF under 1 MB. Most online tools that fix this ask you to
    upload your Aadhaar scan, your marksheet or your signature to someone else's server first.
    NiftyFix exists so you never have to.
  </p>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>On your device.</strong> Every tool runs in your browser, in a sandbox that is not
      allowed to send your files anywhere. You can{' '}
      <a href="/privacy-verification/">check this yourself</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Checked, not guessed.</strong> Tools measure the file they produce and show each
      requirement passing or failing, so you know before you upload.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Honest about limits.</strong> If a requirement cannot be met, the tool says why
      instead of handing you a file that only looks right.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Fast on any connection.</strong> Pages are small and work well on slow mobile data.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we promise</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      The tools are free, with no account, no trial and no surprise payment after the work is done.
    </li>
    <li>No advertising or tracking inside the tools, ever.</li>
    <li>
      {liveTools} tools today, with many more planned in the <a href="/tools/">full catalogue</a>.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we cannot promise</h2>
  <p>
    Portals can apply checks they do not publish, such as face detection or a live photo. We verify
    the technical requirements you give us; we cannot guarantee that a portal will accept a file.
    See our <a href="/terms/">terms of use</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Who builds it</h2>
  <p>
    NiftyFix is designed and built by {OPERATOR.name} in {OPERATOR.region}. Feedback and ideas for
    new tools are always welcome on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>
  <SocialLinks class="mt-4" />
</Prose>
